    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link DiscordianDate#plus(long, TemporalUnit)} when the starting date is St. Tib's Day. <p>In the Discordian calendar, St. Tib's Day is the leap-day inserted between day 59 and day 60 of the first month (Chaos) in a leap year. It belongs to no regular month and is represented as month&nbsp;=&nbsp;0, day&nbsp;=&nbsp;0. Because it sits outside the normal month structure, arithmetic from this date requires special handling."
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
     24,
     26
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "St. Tib's Day in a Discordian leap year is encoded as month=0, day=0. Discordian year 2014 is a leap year (ISO 2014 - 1166 = 848; 848 % 4 == 0). Discordian year 2018 is also a leap year (2018 - 1166 = 852; 852 % 4 == 0)."
   },
   {
    "id": "i3",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
     29,
     30
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "--- DAYS --- Adding 0 days to St. Tib's Day leaves it unchanged"
   },
   {
    "id": "i4",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
     32,
     32
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Adding 8 days crosses into month 1 (day 59 + 1 [St.Tib] + 8 = day 67 of Chaos)"
   },
   {
    "id": "i5",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
     34,
     34
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Subtracting 3 days moves back into Chaos before St. Tib's Day"
   },
   {
